# The floorplan beta's packing solver, kept out of requirements.txt because it ships only
# manylinux_2_35 wheels (glibc 2.35+) and Vercel builds and runs on Amazon Linux 2023 (glibc 2.34),
# where pip finds nothing to install - which failed every production build from June 2026.
# services/placement_service.py imports it lazily and falls back to grid placement without it, so
# production runs Auto-Place on the grid; Docker, CI and local development install it.
pyckingsolver
